Remove stored credentials

Usage: vendo logout [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --all             Remove every saved profile, not just the active one
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -y, --yes             Skip the confirmation prompt for --all
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo logout
  $ vendo logout --all
  $ vendo logout --all --yes
